{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05252","headline":"奉和幸韦嗣立山庄侍宴应制 · 武平一","name":"奉和幸韦嗣立山庄侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三光回斗极，万骑肃钩陈。\n地若游汾水，畋疑历渭滨。\n圆塘冰写镜，遥树露成春。\n弦奏鱼听曲，机忘鸟狎人。\n筑岩思感梦，磻石想垂纶。\n落景摇红壁，层阴结翠筠。\n素风纷可尚，玄泽蔼无垠。\n薄暮清笳动，天文焕紫宸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武平一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}